AUDIO: 'This might genuinely be the coolest AI company out there. It\'s called Desert Ant Labs and they are a European AI lab and they\'ve set out on a very specific mission. Instead of chasing building big models, they\'re building tiny models'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that run entirely on your phone or your laptop offline with no server and no API keys required and with no token cost. So, in this video, we\'ll take a look at 12 of their little AI models, see how'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'they work, and test them out one by one. It\'s going to be a lot of fun. So, let\'s dive into it. So, Desert Ant Lab\'s whole philosophy is'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'built around a certain body part, the cerebellum. It\'s about 10% of your brain by size, but it holds 80% of your brain\'s neurons. And that\'s the part of your brain that handles the fast'

[00:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'thinking and reflexes like balance, timing, coordination. So the rest of your brain is free to think. And Desert Ant Labs wants to apply the same layer for software. So what they\'re doing is'

[01:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'building small specialized models that handle the constant background work on device while the big cloud models handle the actual reasoning. And so far, they\'ve shipped 12 of these for various tasks like converting audio, text, and'

